.claude/feature-state/research.json
.claude/feature-state/plan.json
.claude/feature-state/plan-*.json
.claude/feature-state/steps/
.claude/feature-state/steps-*/
.claude/feature-state/log/
.claude/feature-state/FINAL_REPORT.md
.claude/feature-state/archive/

